msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Starting with the intercept-only model, predictors are entered or removed "
"sequentially based on AIC, combining both forward addition and backward "
"elimination at each step."
msgstr ""
"Comezando co modelo só con constante, os preditores introdúcense e "
"elimínanse secuencialmente en base ao AIC, combinando tanto a adición cara "
"adiante como a eliminación cara atrás, en cada paso."

